{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50754","headline":"陪杭州郡使讌西湖亭 · 张祜","name":"陪杭州郡使讌西湖亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小亭移宴近云端，十里山图马上看。\n青壁远光凌鸟峻，碧湖深影鍳人寒。\n诗成病愈生犀角，酒引娇娃活牡丹。\n归去不须愁暮雨，高唐神女属仙坛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50754.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50754","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}